  "layer": "the lens box extended by 0 pt on every side (layer_pt of each set), overflow hidden, at −0/−0 inside the lens; the lens capsule clips it",
  "requirement": "the source must extend past the lens: with the layer equal to the lens box the outward sampling at the edges reads transparent (1-px coloured lines along the long edges)",
